      "text": "Four tables. Every child row points at jobs.id. PK = primary key, FK = foreign key, UQ = unique, IX = index.",
      "originalText": "Four tables. Every child row points at jobs.id. PK = primary key, FK = foreign key, UQ = unique, IX = index.",
